(All institutional and governmental data is formally categorized into four strict tiers:) Tj
0 -14 Td
(• Tier 1 \(Public / مفتوح\): Public legislation, statistical aggregates, educational materials.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(• Tier 2 \(Confidential / سري\): Inter-agency correspondence, non-critical commercial filings.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(• Tier 3 \(Sovereign Critical / سيادي حساس\): Port manifests, tax revenue, banking RTGS logs.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(• Tier 4 \(Air-Gapped Sovereign / سيادي معزول\): National civil registry, defense telemetry.) Tj
/F1 13 Tf
0 -26 Td
(2. Absolute Prohibition on Cross-Border Data Leakage) Tj
/F2 9 Tf
0 -16 Td
(Under Section 4.2 of this Charter, any cloud architecture routing Tier 3 or Tier 4 records) Tj
0 -13 Td
(through foreign proxy servers, CDNs, or offshore databases constitutes a sovereign breach.) Tj
0 -13 Td
